          "message": {
            "text": "Operator PDF parsers lack enforceable hard deadlines\n\nPdfReader construction and extract_text run synchronously in the main process, so elapsed checks and output caps cannot interrupt a parser that hangs or consumes excessive memory.\n\nSeverity: medium\n\nCategory: Resource exhaustion\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-400\n\nRemediation:\nRun untrusted PDF parsing in disposable worker processes with wall-clock, memory, and output limits and terminate on deadline."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:78156905bf5278b15533058ce51f0664d52eb37be9cc19ad2f3f663b0c8bb617"
          },
