          "message": {
            "text": "Final-output integrity audit buffers unbounded HTTP responses\n\nThe audit helper fetches without a timeout and calls response.text before enforcing any response-byte bound, allowing a slow or oversized configured endpoint to exhaust the audit worker.\n\nSeverity: low\n\nCategory: Resource exhaustion\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-400\n\nRemediation:\nUse AbortController deadlines and a bounded streaming response reader before JSON parsing or preview capture."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:c7e92c31e11b6cbf1239a8d2553b17b055af634232d60642d2a46fff8ffca02a"
