          "message": {
            "text": "Relational tenant tuples are not enforced by composite constraints\n\nIndependent organization, site, workpack, worker, session, and improvement foreign keys plus organization-only RLS permit an authenticated owner with a foreign UUID to create inconsistent cross-tenant relationships.\n\nSeverity: low\n\nCategory: Authorization\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-863\n\nRemediation:\nAdd tenant-consistent composite keys and foreign keys, strengthen WITH CHECK predicates, and clean existing inconsistent tuples before enforcement."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:26b64bbcbcbf7065d93056c9d5c1818908ea03205c291d4c9e03abca7ff140f5"
