          "message": {
            "text": "Null-organization dispatch logs are globally readable and mutable under RLS\n\nThe dispatch_logs FOR ALL policy authorizes rows whenever organization_id is NULL, exposing any legacy or malformed tenantless receipt to every authenticated Data API user.\n\nSeverity: low\n\nCategory: Authorization\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-862\n\nRemediation:\nBackfill or quarantine legacy rows, make organization_id non-null, remove the NULL policy branch, and reserve global audit rows for service-role access."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:a7ff8f51efca4741f1eb323856c51b93d3af247565222c7fc2f06addec65634f"
