          "message": {
            "text": "Release and publication subprocesses lack execution deadlines\n\nTwo privileged release helpers launch fixed test, build, audit, and browser commands with spawnSync but no timeout, allowing a hanging dependency or build input to occupy CI or operator workers indefinitely.\n\nSeverity: low\n\nCategory: Resource exhaustion\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-400\n\nRemediation:\nUse the existing bounded subprocess helper with per-step deadlines, bounded output, process-tree termination, and explicit timeout reporting."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:c2be6996ca2a5834b75f894d0cfb4a89c571ccb990721247ae24650da5bb275c"
          },
