          "message": {
            "text": "HWPX inventory reads full files before enforcing a size limit\n\nThe inventory helper reads each candidate HWPX completely into memory before inspecting metadata and has no pre-read byte ceiling.\n\nSeverity: low\n\nCategory: Resource exhaustion\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-400\n\nRemediation:\nStat and reject oversized files before reading, parse only a bounded ZIP tail or central directory, and cap entry counts and directory bytes."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:1ffb34377a7a2ed07ccaf842b3587e4a7e9fd9982db69012c73822d236b833ac"
