          "message": {
            "text": "Concurrent workspace provisioning can create duplicate organizations and sites\n\nFirst-use provisioning performs select-then-insert for organizations and sites without matching uniqueness constraints, allowing concurrent requests to create duplicates.\n\nSeverity: low\n\nCategory: Race condition\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-362\n\nRemediation:\nAdd owner and organization/name uniqueness constraints and replace select-then-insert with conflict-safe upserts or a transactional provisioning function."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:176049aedffd218a2b78f1fa6d97b4f07a693946ef30fa03986362e443bc5d5f"
