            }
          ],
          "message": {
            "text": "Workbook budgets apply after ExcelJS materialization\n\nThe final-output parser preflights the OOXML archive but ExcelJS materializes the entire workbook before sheet, row, cell, and elapsed budgets are enforced.\n\nSeverity: low\n\nCategory: Resource exhaustion\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-400\n\nRemediation:\nParse workbook XML in a bounded streaming worker or enforce projected worksheet and cell limits before ExcelJS allocation, with an external hard deadline and memory cap."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:148848059237d30fa78cf3b4658fea5ef51c3fd1d5ab5c1f544c9f4d76a66313"
