          "message": {
            "text": "Tenant clients can forge server-authoritative workflow state\n\nBroad tenant-owner FOR ALL policies allow direct Data API writes to review, approval, provider, recipient-policy, and regeneration state that application routes otherwise validate as authoritative.\n\nSeverity: medium\n\nCategory: Authorization\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-602\n\nRemediation:\nRevoke direct client writes to authoritative fields; use server-only transitions or constrained RPCs and immutable authenticated review receipts."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:0ecfbda7a5af405d38eeb763c8ffd66f5d03eedf587b3b33c92affe711fb72c4"
