          "message": {
            "text": "Public legal-search page loses request-disconnect cancellation\n\nThe search page passes a synthetic Request to the coalesced provider search, leaving a never-aborted consumer after the real page request disconnects.\n\nSeverity: medium\n\nCategory: Resource exhaustion\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-400\n\nRemediation:\nRoute page search through the existing cancellation-aware API or supply a real request-lifetime signal and promptly release coalesced consumers."
          },
