          "message": {
            "text": "Legacy query and document tables lack row-level authorization\n\nThe public-schema query_logs and documents tables are created without RLS or policies, leaving stored query and document content dependent on unproven external grant hardening.\n\nSeverity: medium\n\nCategory: Authorization\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-862\n\nRemediation:\nEnable RLS, revoke unnecessary anon/authenticated grants, add narrowly scoped policies or service-role-only access, and verify effective deployed grants."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:754020e9de099f22971b372494a849fafa6724098173b12a2f88a46e50d34e78"
          },
