                "region": {
                  "endLine": 1941,
                  "startLine": 1925
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "message": {
            "text": "KOSHA corpus bytes can change after identity capture\n\nThe snapshot workflow hashes and inventories corpus paths, then later reopens ZIPs or direct PDFs without binding parsed bytes to the captured digest and member metadata.\n\nSeverity: medium\n\nCategory: Integrity\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-367\n\nRemediation:\nParse immutable staged copies or retained descriptors; otherwise revalidate file digest and ZIP member CRC and sizes immediately before every read."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:643824808b66d8a59dad0c947496fb85038391f6f02f5a6421a61bfbd4211255"
